• PANGA (The Utility Engine): A precision-engineered token with a 9-decimal architecture, specifically optimized to facilitate high-frequency micro-transactions within the arcade environment.
• THE ARCADE VAULT: A centralized reward management contract (ZAARD_Arcade_Vault) that connects decentralized betting logic with immutable prize distribution.

